          %h2#literature Literature
          %p
            For more see the references at
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group+theory"} group theory
          %p Textbook accounts:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mark+A.+Armstrong"}> Mark A. Armstrong
              \:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Groups and Symmetry
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-1-4757-4034-9"} doi:10.1007/978-1-4757-4034-9
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://superoles.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/lluvia.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            The terminology “group” was introduced (for what today would more specifically be called
            = succeed ")" do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/permutation+groups"} permutation groups
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%C3%89variste+Galois"}> Évariste Galois
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Galois%27+last+letter"} letter to Auguste Chevallier
          %p The original article that gives a definition equivalent to the modern definition of a group:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Heinrich+Weber"}> Heinrich Weber
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Beweis des Satzes, dass jede eigentlich primitive quadratische Form unendlich viele Primzahlen darzustellen fähig ist
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/bf01443599"} doi:10.1007/bf01443599
          %p
            Introduction of group theory into (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+physics"}> quantum
            )
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/physics"} physics
            (cf.
            = succeed "):" do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gruppenpest"} Gruppenpest
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hermann+Weyl"}> Hermann Weyl
              , §III in:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Gruppentheorie und Quantenmechanik
              = succeed "," do
                %em The Theory of Groups and Quantum Mechanics
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://store.doverpublications.com/0486602699.html"} ISBN:0486602699
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://archive.org/details/ost-chemistry-quantumtheoryofa029235mbp/page/n15/mode/2up"} ark:/13960/t1kh1w36w
          %p
            Textbook account in relation to applications in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/physics"} physics
          %ul
            %li#Sternberg94
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shlomo+Sternberg"}> Shlomo Sternberg
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Group Theory and Physics
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.cambridge.org/gb/academic/subjects/mathematics/algebra/group-theory-and-physics?format=PB&isbn=9780521558853"} ISBN:9780521558853
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Wikipedia,
                %em
                  %a{:href => "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Group_(mathematics)"} Group_(mathematics)
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bananaspace"}> bananaspace
                ,
                %em
                  %a{:href => "https://www.bananaspace.org/wiki/%E7%BE%A4"} 群
                (Chinese)
          %p#TTFormalizations
            Formalization of group structure in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dependent+type+theory"} dependent type theory
          %p
            in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Rocq"} Rocq
          %ul
            %li
              Farida Kachapova,
              %em Formalizing groups in type theory
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2102.09125"}> arXiv:2102.09125
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            and with the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/univalence+axiom"} univalence axiom
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/unimath"} unimath
              \-&gt;
              %a{:href => "https://unimath.github.io/doc/UniMath/d4de26f//UniMath.Algebra.Groups.html"} UniMath.Algebra.Groups
          %p
            in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Agda"} Agda
          %ul
            %li
              %p
